<title>LUXEMBOURG: Quilmes Industrial says Q1 profit higher.</title>
<headline>Quilmes Industrial says Q1 profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg-based holding company Quilmes Industrial said on Wednesday its profits rose in the first quarter of this year.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Net sales			256.2	    vs   236.7</p>
<p> Gross profit		   140.5	    vs   128.4</p>
<p> Net income			26.0	    vs    23.9</p>
<p> Cash flow			 45.2	    vs    39.3</p>
<p> Net income/share (dollars)   0.244	  vs     0.233</p>
<p>NOTE: Quilmes Industrial controls 85 percent of Quilmes International (Bermuda).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
